  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 160,
      "end_ms": 3140,
      "text": "我们今天要把这首凤歌给他唱了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 3140,
      "end_ms": 5960,
      "text": "这里的这个衰字念催啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 5960,
      "end_ms": 8020,
      "text": "意思就是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 8820,
      "end_ms": 13930,
      "text": "按照一定的等级递减掉下来啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 13930,
      "end_ms": 18050,
      "text": "就得其实应该何如得之崔啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 19170,
      "end_ms": 24050,
      "text": "就是你能拿世间道德"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 24050,
      "end_ms": 26810,
      "text": "就是德行的降低"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 27170,
      "end_ms": 28730,
      "text": "拿他怎么办啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 28730,
      "end_ms": 30010,
      "text": "所以这个念催啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 30010,
      "end_ms": 33490,
      "text": "就是一个等等地的降低啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 37960,
      "end_ms": 40160,
      "text": "风起"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 44520,
      "end_ms": 47720,
      "text": "喝得直摧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 53340,
      "end_ms": 55780,
      "text": "风起"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 59700,
      "end_ms": 63100,
      "text": "哈得志翠"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 68740,
      "end_ms": 70900,
      "text": "风起"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 75060,
      "end_ms": 78540,
      "text": "♪ 喝得至摧 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 83700,
      "end_ms": 86180,
      "text": "♪ 风信 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 90260,
      "end_ms": 93700,
      "text": "阿得至翠"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 107640,
      "end_ms": 111670,
      "text": "♪ 来者不带追 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 111670,
      "end_ms": 118160,
      "text": "♪ 来者良德倏忽可见 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 121360,
      "end_ms": 124640,
      "text": "♪ 蛇身而去 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 124640,
      "end_ms": 126620,
      "text": "一者也"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 128259,
      "end_ms": 132710,
      "text": "♪ 望者不可见 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 134440,
      "end_ms": 136120,
      "text": "♪ 天下有道 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 138040,
      "end_ms": 140400,
      "text": "♪ 圣人沉言 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 141290,
      "end_ms": 142970,
      "text": "♪ 涉世无道 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 144530,
      "end_ms": 147330,
      "text": "♪ 苟且神严 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 152060,
      "end_ms": 163620,
      "text": "♪ 我之所抚琴胡语载而不可取 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 165800,
      "end_ms": 170800,
      "text": "♪ 福之所以众苦 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 170800,
      "end_ms": 177390,
      "text": "♪ 地莫知之所必 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 179100,
      "end_ms": 180780,
      "text": "♪ 天下无道 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 182740,
      "end_ms": 187570,
      "text": "♪ 圣人神厌方今之事 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 189170,
      "end_ms": 191930,
      "text": "♪ 今年新颜 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 193380,
      "end_ms": 194380,
      "text": "♪ 一而 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 196460,
      "end_ms": 198860,
      "text": "♪ 令人意得 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 200240,
      "end_ms": 201200,
      "text": "♪ 一而 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 203320,
      "end_ms": 205800,
      "text": "令人易得"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 207060,
      "end_ms": 208100,
      "text": "带护"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 210220,
      "end_ms": 212660,
      "text": "♪ 划地而去 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 213900,
      "end_ms": 215900,
      "text": "♪ 黛乎 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 216890,
      "end_ms": 219530,
      "text": "划地而去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 272360,
      "end_ms": 273400,
      "text": "♪ 绵阳 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 275480,
      "end_ms": 277960,
      "text": "♪ 无声无形 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 279220,
      "end_ms": 280220,
      "text": "♪ 绵阳 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 282340,
      "end_ms": 284780,
      "text": "五行西去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 286020,
      "end_ms": 286980,
      "text": "♪ 谜谣 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 289300,
      "end_ms": 291700,
      "text": "♪ 无声无形 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 292940,
      "end_ms": 293900,
      "text": "♪ 谜样 ♪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 296060,
      "end_ms": 297720,
      "text": "♪ 无商无阻 ♪"
    }
  ],
  "text": "我们今天要把这首凤歌给他唱了啊\n这里的这个衰字念催啊\n意思就是\n按照一定的等级递减掉下来啊\n就得其实应该何如得之崔啊\n就是你能拿世间道德\n就是德行的降低\n拿他怎么办啊\n所以这个念催啊\n就是一个等等地的降低啊\n风起\n喝得直摧\n风起\n哈得志翠\n风起\n♪ 喝得至摧 ♪\n♪ 风信 ♪\n阿得至翠\n♪ 来者不带追 ♪\n♪ 来者良德倏忽可见 ♪\n♪ 蛇身而去 ♪\n一者也\n♪ 望者不可见 ♪\n♪ 天下有道 ♪\n♪ 圣人沉言 ♪\n♪ 涉世无道 ♪\n♪ 苟且神严 ♪\n♪ 我之所抚琴胡语载而不可取 ♪\n♪ 福之所以众苦 ♪\n♪ 地莫知之所必 ♪\n♪ 天下无道 ♪\n♪ 圣人神厌方今之事 ♪\n♪ 今年新颜 ♪\n♪ 一而 ♪\n♪ 令人意得 ♪\n♪ 一而 ♪\n令人易得\n带护\n♪ 划地而去 ♪\n♪ 黛乎 ♪\n划地而去\n♪ 绵阳 ♪\n♪ 无声无形 ♪\n♪ 绵阳 ♪\n五行西去\n♪ 谜谣 ♪\n♪ 无声无形 ♪\n♪ 谜样 ♪\n♪ 无商无阻 ♪",
